P actions make_etude
P memjob 1024000
P memory_limit 1024.0
P mode interactif
P nomjob AsterThermal
P version stable
A args -max_base 300000
A memjeveux 128.0
A tpmax 20000.0
F comm AsterThermalparam.in D  1
F comm AsterThermal.comm D  1
F libr AsterThermalinput.med D  20
F rmed AsterThermaloutput.rmed R  80
F mess AsterThermal.log R  6
